Ampheck-authored integration and porting changes in this source include Linux
7.3 API migration, Kconfig/Makefile integration, RK628 V4L2 and D-PHY
adaptation, RKNPU devfreq use of simple_ondemand, OF device-table exports,
Rockchip IOMMU domain control, and RK356x NPU/power-domain/device-tree wiring.
These changes do not alter the copyright ownership of the imported code.

The integration patches under common/kernel/patches modify GPL-2.0-only or
GPL-2.0+ Linux kernel code, or dual-licensed GPL-2.0+/MIT device-tree code, and
remain under the license of the affected source files. The Rockchip boot-mode
integration patch under common/uboot/patches is Ampheck-authored and remains
under U-Boot's GPL-2.0+ license.

