    source tree.

  Ubuntu Base 24.04
    Ubuntu packages and their contents remain subject to the copyright and
    license terms recorded by the respective packages and the Ubuntu
    distribution.

  Android platform-tools adbd 34.0.5
    Ubuntu Noble does not publish a device-side adbd binary package. The SDK
