    Android support libraries from pinned .deb URLs. adbd and its Android
    platform libraries are primarily Apache-2.0 and retain additional
    BSD/Expat notices as recorded in their package copyright files.

  GRUB 2.12-1ubuntu7.3
    The boot ESP is generated from Ubuntu's grub-efi-arm64-bin package.
    GRUB is licensed under GPL-3+. Its package copyright is provided in
    legal/grub-efi-arm64-bin.copyright, and corresponding source locations are
    listed in legal/ASSETS-MANIFEST and included in the source release asset.

  Device tree files
    Ampheck device-tree files marked "GPL-2.0+ OR MIT" retain that dual
    license. Patches to GPL-2.0-only kernel or U-Boot code remain GPL-2.0.

